    <briefdescription>
<para>Draws the gesture or the selected region of a <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1SelectionTool" kindref="compound">SelectionTool</ref>, clipped to the plot area. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The item lives in the overlay of the tool&apos;s plot, below the overlay&apos;s other children, and is owned by the tool. </para>
